% Beetle is a car. Every car is green or blue, and either colour would make
% Beetle beautiful. The query concludes that Beetle is beautiful.
% Shows proof by cases with a disjunctive conclusion and two entailments.
% See https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disjunction_elimination

the templates are:
    *a thing* is a car,
    *a thing* has property *a first property* or *a second property*,
    *a property* entails beauty,
    *a thing* is beautiful.

the knowledge base beetle includes:
beetle is a car.

a car has property green or blue
    if the car is a car.

green entails beauty.
blue entails beauty.

% The conclusion follows when both alternatives entail beauty.
a thing is beautiful
    if the thing has property a first property or a second property
    and the first property entails beauty
    and the second property entails beauty.

query beautiful is:
    beetle is beautiful.
